    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "We'd have money for insurance if it wasn't for you. If your mother didn't put all that money aside for your 'education' ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3180
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "My mum and dad never got legally married. Better for tax, my dad used to say. It's always about the business with him",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7122
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The second he turned eighteen Jason took the money and gave it straight to Dad. I'm the selfish one because I actually w",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7640
        }
      ],
      "words": 30
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "That your dad sucks? It’s a bit hard to do it over text,” Eden snorts into her cup of tea",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8037
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You're coming home with me.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8812
        }
      ],
      "words": 5
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "But being in this car with her? Well, that's easy. Easier than breathing",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9528
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Rachel's the youngest. Now she will be obsessed with you. Molly and Charlie are the twins",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10688
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I can see where Eden gets her features from. Dark hair from her mum, hazel eyes from her dad",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14399
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
